    "%@ 讀不到。若它在外接碟上，請確認硬碟已連接。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ is unavailable. If it is on an external drive, check the connection."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ 讀不到。若它在外接碟上，請確認硬碟已連接。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@前的自動備份失敗，已停止批次動作": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Automatic backup before %@ failed. The batch action was stopped."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@前的自動備份失敗，已停止批次動作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@，%@ 個連結。只移除身分相符的整理連結，保留原始音檔及後來替換的檔案。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@, %@ links. Only matching organized links will be removed. Original audio and replacement files will be preserved."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@，%@ 個連結。只移除身分相符的整理連結，保留原始音檔及後來替換的檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@：路徑沒有可用線索，維持未分類": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@: no usable path evidence; remains unclassified"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@：路徑沒有可用線索，維持未分類"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AI 的建議一直都只寫在建議欄裡，要你接受才會生效。這裡只是讓你按一次算幾千次——不是讓程式替你決定。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Suggestions take effect only after you accept them. This applies your decision to a batch; it does not decide for you."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI 的建議一直都只寫在建議欄裡，要你接受才會生效。這裡只是讓你按一次算幾千次——不是讓程式替你決定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
