    "。已保留檔案：": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": ". Preserved files: "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "。已保留檔案："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「%@」這個分頁會消失。\n音檔本身不會被刪除，磁碟上的檔案一個都不會變。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The collection “%@” will be removed.\nAudio files on disk will remain unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」這個分頁會消失。\n音檔本身不會被刪除，磁碟上的檔案一個都不會變。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不呼叫任何模型，也不會把你的檔名送到任何地方。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No models are called, and your filenames are never sent anywhere."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不呼叫任何模型，也不會把你的檔名送到任何地方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不從 nib 建立": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not initialized from a nib"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不從 nib 建立"
