    "分頁、人工設定的分類與風格、接受過的建議，只存在這個資料庫裡，而且它在系統碟上不在你的音色庫碟上。大量寫入前會自動備份，保留最新 %@ 份。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collections, manual categories and styles, and accepted suggestions are stored in this database on the system drive. A backup is required before batch changes; the latest %@ backups are kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分頁、人工設定的分類與風格、接受過的建議，只存在這個資料庫裡，而且它在系統碟上不在你的音色庫碟上。大量寫入前會自動備份，保留最新 %@ 份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "分頁是從**已經接受**的分類來的，不是從建議。先用「批次接受建議」把分析結果套用上去，這裡才會有東西。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Collections use **accepted** categories. First apply analysis results using “Batch Accept Suggestions.”"
